# Defence in depth (spec 015 section 5). build-mcpb.sh already stages ONLY the
# files below in a fresh directory; this allow-list guarantees nothing else
# (build artifacts, .env files, keys) is ever packed even if staging changes.
# NOTE: `!server` must not have a trailing slash — the mcpb CLI's ignore
# checker tests directory entries as bare paths, and a trailing-slash pattern
# matches no entry, so the whole subtree (including the binary) is skipped.
*
!manifest.json
!icon.png
!README.md
!LICENSE
!server
!server/pdfm-mcp
